      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Heel pain is often attributed to a biomechanical etiology or sports-related injury. However, failure to recognize an infectious cause can lead to a delay in proper treatment and result in severe patient disability. This article reviews some of the more common infectious etiologies of heel pain."},
